# Whitelist: ship only what runs. Sources, tests, docs, configs and tooling stay out of the package.
**
!package.json
!README.md
!CHANGELOG.md
!LICENSE
!resources/icon.png
!resources/icon.svg
!media/*.png
!out/src/**
# Never ship type maps, declaration files or TypeScript sources, even inside out/src.
out/**/*.map
out/**/*.d.ts
**/*.ts
